e-image generation to consistently select the Java 9 multi-release implementation.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"Forcing the java CPU variant validates the JCA provider and reachability metadata but does not cover BC-FIPS native AES/SHA acceleration.\",\n    \"Successful execution in a native image does not by itself establish that the resulting deployment is within BC-FIPS's certified platform boundary.\"\n  ]\n}", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b9207a9aa79ef4f016a804366ffdc8191a59c42c271b565d6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 21048, "output": 720, "cacheRead": 8704, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 465, "totalTokens": 30472, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1786790743515, "responseId": "resp_0b9207a9aa79ef4f016a804357c58c8191bcfae830fbf70254", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
